     1569       ASSIGN
     1570          FRAME InfoFrame:HIDDEN                           = TRUE
     1571          StopBtn:sensitive IN FRAME InfoFrame             = TRUE.
     1572     end.
     1573   ON CHOOSE OF StopBtn IN FRAME InfoFrame
     1574   DO:
