     1688     PUT stream PrnLibStream SPACE(30) "Отчет по исполнению заказов за период с: " x-date-start format "99/99/9999" "г. по: "  x-date-end format "99/99/9999" "г." SKIP .
     1689     PUT stream PrnLibStream str1 format "X(100)" SKIP  str2 format "X(100)" SKIP  str3 format "X(100)" SKIP .
     1690   if p-ext-art then do:
